<div id="content-auditoria-regular">
  <div id="panel-auditoria-regular" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="btn-auditoria-regular" aria-hidden="true" class="tabs__result tabs__result--auditoria-regular">
    <div><div class="lfr-layout-structure-item-bbf23342-9fe2-7267-f76c-29c677a1d595 lfr-layout-structure-item-container "><div class="lfr-layout-structure-item-basic-component-heading lfr-layout-structure-item-92045f25-19f2-8fbc-630e-57191f310bff title-auditoria"><div id="fragment-18ab2e59-8672-3dc5-cdd7-2a0d22bb7405"> <h3 class="component-heading mb-0 text-break" data-lfr-editable-id="element-text" data-lfr-editable-type="text">Auditoria Regular</h3></div><style>.fragment-heading-text-colored a {
	color: inherit;
}</style></div><div class="lfr-layout-structure-item-basic-component-paragraph lfr-layout-structure-item-5d7a8dc5-f912-b0dc-cb25-1441434db5e2 paragraph-auditoria"><div id="fragment-d1df86d5-1faf-71cb-37e9-787d0dc9513c"> <div class="clearfix component-paragraph text-break" data-lfr-editable-id="element-text" data-lfr-editable-type="rich-text">Periodicamente, realizamos auditorias nos Participantes para avaliar a sua infraestrutura física e tecnológica e seus procedimentos, processos e controles. As principais etapas desse tipo de auditoria são:</div></div><style>.component-paragraph img {
	max-width: 100%;
}</style></div><div class="lfr-layout-structure-item-512b86c6-1105-651f-c45f-a75db419cb38 lfr-layout-structure-item-container "><div class="lfr-layout-structure-item-basic-component-paragraph lfr-layout-structure-item-0529dc82-2ab2-d6a6-902f-0a4e85993088 paragraph-auditoria"><div id="fragment-9659350a-8ac2-2f32-8b24-43df849f75e7"> <div class="clearfix component-paragraph text-break" data-lfr-editable-id="element-text" data-lfr-editable-type="rich-text">• Reunião de Abertura<br>
• Reuniões de entendimento dos processos e controles (Walkthrough);<br>
• Execução de testes;<br>
• Validação dos pontos identificados; e<br>
• Reunião de fechamento e emissão do relatório final de auditoria.</div></div></div></div><div class="lfr-layout-structure-item-basic-component-paragraph lfr-layout-structure-item-c5e2913e-c969-49a1-182a-b06308fc8133 paragraph-auditoria"><div id="fragment-953fec93-c134-3861-2fd2-f2ab8c7332e6"> <div class="clearfix component-paragraph text-break" data-lfr-editable-id="element-text" data-lfr-editable-type="rich-text">A partir dos resultados das auditorias regulares, os podem ser dispensados em ciclos de auditoria regular em anos posteriores, com base na metodologia proprietária desenvolvida pela BSM disponível na <span class="text-success"><a href="https://www.bsmsupervisao.com.br/documents/1266368/1723432/NS+02-2025+-+Atualiza%C3%A7%C3%A3o+da+NS+de+Dispensa+de+Auditoria.pdf/76f144b8-dddb-adaf-8dd3-c6d26b688f05?version=2.0&amp;t=1737999654193&amp;&amp;objectDefinitionExternalReferenceCode=6983da10-9877-ce3d-046d-d31627e56f16&amp;objectEntryExternalReferenceCode=f7c51230-3e1a-73f1-5adb-dfcb808ff597" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Norma 02/2025 sobre Resultado e Dispensa dos Participantes</a>.</span></div></div></div></div></div>
  </div>
</div></div><script type="module">const configuration = {"isStandard":false,"label":"Auditoria Regular","idTab":"auditoria-regular"}; const fragmentElement = document.querySelector('#fragment-7190d997-005a-5366-e5a1-f5979c91fc5a'); const fragmentEntryLinkNamespace = 'okqs'; const fragmentNamespace = 'okqs'; const layoutMode = 'view';const createPanel = () => {
